{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31056","headline":"许州题德星亭 · 薛能","name":"许州题德星亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瀵水南流东有堤，堤边亭是武陵溪。\n槎松配石堪僧坐，蘂杏含春欲鸟啼。\n高树月生沧海外，远郊山在夕阳西。\n频来不似军从事，只戴纱巾曳杖藜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}